@startuml
state Initial State {
  [*] -> LoginScreen
}

state LoginScreen
state RoleSelection
state CreatingQuiz
state EditingQuiz
state ViewingResults
state SelectingQuiz
state AnsweringQuestions
state SubmittingAnswers

LoginScreen --> RoleSelection : successful login
RoleSelection --> CreatingQuiz : select teacher
RoleSelection --> SelectingQuiz : select student

CreatingQuiz --> CreatingQuiz : Create Quiz Event
CreatingQuiz --> EditingQuiz : Edit Quiz Event
CreatingQuiz --> ViewingResults : Post Quiz Event
CreatingQuiz --> CreatingQuiz : Save Draft Event

EditingQuiz --> CreatingQuiz : Back to Creating
EditingQuiz --> ViewingResults : Post Edited Quiz
EditingQuiz --> EditingQuiz : Save Draft Event

SelectingQuiz --> AnsweringQuestions : Start Quiz Notification
AnsweringQuestions --> SubmittingAnswers : Submit Answers Event
SubmittingAnswers --> ViewingResults : Finalize Submission
ViewingResults --> [*] : Exit System

CreatingQuiz --> CreatingQuiz : Resume Creation
ViewingResults --> [*] : Logout
end state
@enduml
